# Origin of the deployed API server (no trailing slash).
#
# Web builds: leave this unset. The game is served from the same origin as the
# API, so relative /api and /ws paths work.
#
# Capacitor / mobile builds: REQUIRED. The packaged app is served from
# capacitor://localhost (iOS) or https://localhost (Android), so relative paths
# point at the app bundle and never reach the server — the Arcade leaderboard
# and Online multiplayer would both fail silently. vite.config.capacitor.ts
# refuses to build without it.
#
# Must be http:// or https://. Android blocks mixed content, so real device
# builds need https.
#
# The WebSocket URL is derived from this automatically (https -> wss).
VITE_API_ORIGIN=https://api.example.com
